            "summary": "Art only belongs to you while you're creating it. When you have put it on the internet it is no longer yours. Yeah, sure you have intellectual property over it, but it is no…",
            "html": "<article id=\"post-28343\" class=\"post-28343 post type-post status-publish format-quote hentry post_format-post-format-quote category-autoria-de-outros category-citacoes category-english category-filosofia tag-ai-art tag-art tag-creativity tag-intelectual-property tag-internet\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#autoria-de-outros\" rel=\"category\">Autoria de Outros</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#citacoes\" rel=\"category\">Citações</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#english\" rel=\"category\">English</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#filosofia\" rel=\"category\">Filosofia</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"reader.html#2022-12-13-art-only-belongs-to-you-while-youre-creating-it.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">Art only belongs to you while you’re creating it</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#quote\">Citação</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"reader.html#2022-12-13-art-only-belongs-to-you-while-youre-creating-it.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2022-12-13T03:53:01-03:00\">13/12/2022</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"reader.html#2022-12-13-art-only-belongs-to-you-while-youre-creating-it.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#ai-art\" rel=\"tag\">AI Art</a> <a href=\"tag.html#art\" rel=\"tag\">Art</a> <a href=\"tag.html#creativity\" rel=\"tag\">Creativity</a> <a href=\"tag.html#intelectual-property\" rel=\"tag\">Intelectual Property</a> <a href=\"tag.html#internet\" rel=\"tag\">Internet</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\">\n<blockquote>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Art only belongs to you while you&#8217;re creating it. When you have put it on the internet it is no longer yours. Yeah, sure you have intellectual property over it, but it is no longer yours it is for the people. If you want art to be yours and yours alone, simply don&#8217;t publish it. The moment you publish something it belongs to everyone else. You only have publisher, let&#8217;s say, privilege, author rights and such, but that doesn&#8217;t mean it won&#8217;t be counterfeited, it doesn&#8217;t mean it won&#8217;t be stolen and resold and most likely even used for AI technology to replicate it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/8qgzwj8mkZA?t=140\">Ferenjianboard Introspection Protocols – Annoyed by AI art and its ability to replicate? Well, cope with it, it&#8217;s gonna stay </a><br /><br /></p>\n</div></article>",
